# Casa del Coleccionista (Ciudad Nodo), 9 x 7, interior (F2, contract 74; map id 179). column = i, row = j. A bug collector's front room: glass display cases along the wall, a bookshelf, a worktable and a planter of ferns.
# In-game trade (lanternmoth -> velvex): he wants a LANTERNMOTH and gives a VELVEX whose nickname is the fixed ASCII text `tr_ins.nick` (the same in all four languages: the trade idiom of casa_mimo,
# contract 32.5). Flag 927 = the trade was done.
@map casa_insectos
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@flag ins_done 927
@var ins_res 5
@var ins_want 6
@var ins_give 7
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  B  object=bookshelf interact=look text=casa.books
  V  object=vitrina interact=look text=tr_ins.case
  P  object=planter
  T  object=table
  L  npc=explorador id=trader face=SW script=trader
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwwywwyww
  |VBV.VP..
  |...L....
  |.....T..
  q....P...
  |........
  |...mm...
@warp m -> ciudad_nodo spawn=insectos_door
@script trader npc
    npc_face_hero trader
    setv ins_want sp:lanternmoth
    setv ins_give sp:velvex
    name_var 0 ins_want
    name_var 1 ins_give
    jf ins_done after
    say tr_ins.hello
    ask trueque.ask
    jv 0 1 go
    say trueque.no
    end
  go:
    trade lanternmoth velvex tr_ins.nick ins_res
    jv ins_res 1 done
    jv ins_res 255 cancel
    say trueque.wrong
    end
  cancel:
    say trueque.no
    end
  done:
    setf ins_done
    say trueque.done
    end
  after:
    name_var 0 ins_give
    say trueque.after
@end
